        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: La jolie fille de Perth, Mitridate, re di Ponto\n- People: Georges Bizet, Jules-Henri Vernoy de Saint-Georges, Jules Adenis, Sir Walter Scott, Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart\n- Concepts: opera, opera seria, libretto, novel\n\nFacts:\n- La jolie fille de Perth (\"The Fair Maid of Perth\") is an opera in four acts by Georges Bizet.\n- La jolie fille de Perth has a libretto by Jules-Henri Vernoy de Saint-Georges and Jules Adenis.\n- La jolie fille de Perth is based on a novel by Sir Walter Scott.\n- Mitridate, re di Ponto (\"Mithridates, King of Pontus\"), K. 87 (74a), is an early opera seria in three acts by Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart.",
